            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A local suppression may hide a policy or security defect."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Local lint or security suppression signal.\n\n**Why it matters.** A local suppression may hide a policy or security defect.\n\n**How to verify.** Run the owning analyser without the suppression, establish the exact diagnostic, and verify a tracked, source-specific justification or remove the suppression.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Local lint or security suppression signal.\n\nWhy it matters: A local suppression may hide a policy or security defect.\nHow to verify: Run the owning analyser without the suppression, establish the exact diagnostic, and verify a tracked, source-specific justification or remove the suppression."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#ta005-lint-suppression",
              "id": "TA005-lint-suppression",
              "name": "TA005-lint-suppression",
