              "help": {
                "markdown": "Test has no local behavioural contract signal.\n\n**Why it matters.** The test exposes no local assertion, exception, or behavioural helper call.\n\n**How to verify.** Identify the observable production regression this test catches and add an explicit result, state, persistence, error, or integration contract.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Test has no local behavioural contract signal.\n\nWhy it matters: The test exposes no local assertion, exception, or behavioural helper call.\nHow to verify: Identify the observable production regression this test catches and add an explicit result, state, persistence, error, or integration contract."
