            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The test directly reaches an underscored first-party production surface."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Test directly reaches an underscored first-party surface.\n\n**Why it matters.** The test directly reaches an underscored first-party production surface.\n\n**How to verify.** Run the behaviour through the public API, CLI, adapter, pipeline, or documented internal contract and prove that the private call is not bypassing that boundary.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Test directly reaches an underscored first-party surface.\n\nWhy it matters: The test directly reaches an underscored first-party production surface.\nHow to verify: Run the behaviour through the public API, CLI, adapter, pipeline, or documented internal contract and prove that the private call is not bypassing that boundary."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#ta011-private-production-surface",
