            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "tempfile.mktemp returns a name with a race between the check and the later open."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Insecure temporary file creation through tempfile.mktemp.\n\n**Why it matters.** tempfile.mktemp returns a name with a race between the check and the later open.\n\n**How to verify.** Use tempfile.mkstemp or NamedTemporaryFile, which create the file atomically with a bound descriptor.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Insecure temporary file creation through tempfile.mktemp.\n\nWhy it matters: tempfile.mktemp returns a name with a race between the check and the later open.\nHow to verify: Use tempfile.mkstemp or NamedTemporaryFile, which create the file atomically with a bound descriptor."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#as005-insecure-temporary-file",
              "id": "AS005-insecure-temporary-file",
