              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A bare except catches every exception, including SystemExit and KeyboardInterrupt, so it hides real failures and blocks interruption."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Bare except clause that catches every exception and hides real failures.\n\n**Why it matters.** A bare except catches every exception, including SystemExit and KeyboardInterrupt, so it hides real failures and blocks interruption.\n\n**How to verify.** Catch the specific exception types the block can actually handle, or re-raise after recording context; never swallow BaseException silently.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Bare except clause that catches every exception and hides real failures.\n\nWhy it matters: A bare except catches every exception, including SystemExit and KeyboardInterrupt, so it hides real failures and blocks interruption.\nHow to verify: Catch the specific exception types the block can actually handle, or re-raise after recording context; never swallow BaseException silently."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#rl001-bare-except",
              "id": "RL001-bare-except",
              "name": "RL001-bare-except",
