            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A dependency installed directly from a VCS checkout or a URL bypasses the package index and hash pinning, so the resolved artefact is mutable and unverified."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Dependency installed from a VCS checkout or URL, bypassing index hash pinning.\n\n**Why it matters.** A dependency installed directly from a VCS checkout or a URL bypasses the package index and hash pinning, so the resolved artefact is mutable and unverified.\n\n**How to verify.** Pin the dependency to an immutable released version from the index with a recorded hash, or vendor and audit the exact revision if a direct source is genuinely required.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Dependency installed from a VCS checkout or URL, bypassing index hash pinning.\n\nWhy it matters: A dependency installed directly from a VCS checkout or a URL bypasses the package index and hash pinning, so the resolved artefact is mutable and unverified.\nHow to verify: Pin the dependency to an immutable released version from the index with a recorded hash, or vendor and audit the exact revision if a direct source is genuinely required."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#sc002-vcs-url-requirement",
