            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A PEM private-key block is embedded in tracked source, disclosing key material to everyone with repository read access."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "PEM private-key block embedded in tracked source, disclosing key material.\n\n**Why it matters.** A PEM private-key block is embedded in tracked source, disclosing key material to everyone with repository read access.\n\n**How to verify.** Remove the key from source, rotate it, and load it at runtime from a secret store or an out-of-tree file that is never committed.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "PEM private-key block embedded in tracked source, disclosing key material.\n\nWhy it matters: A PEM private-key block is embedded in tracked source, disclosing key material to everyone with repository read access.\nHow to verify: Remove the key from source, rotate it, and load it at runtime from a secret store or an out-of-tree file that is never committed."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#dp002-embedded-private-key",
              "id": "DP002-embedded-private-key",
