            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A tracked source owner has no SPDX licence identifier in its leading header, so automated licence inventory cannot establish its declared licence."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Tracked source owner lacks an SPDX licence identifier in its leading header.\n\n**Why it matters.** A tracked source owner has no SPDX licence identifier in its leading header, so automated licence inventory cannot establish its declared licence.\n\n**How to verify.** Confirm the file's intended licence with the repository owner, then add the exact SPDX-License-Identifier header or record why the source is separately licensed.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Tracked source owner lacks an SPDX licence identifier in its leading header.\n\nWhy it matters: A tracked source owner has no SPDX licence identifier in its leading header, so automated licence inventory cannot establish its declared licence.\nHow to verify: Confirm the file's intended licence with the repository owner, then add the exact SPDX-License-Identifier header or record why the source is separately licensed."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#dc001-missing-license-header",
              "id": "DC001-missing-license-header",
