            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A public README or documentation page names an explicit package version that differs from the repository's static PEP 621 project version."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Public package-version guidance differs from static PEP 621 project metadata.\n\n**Why it matters.** A public README or documentation page names an explicit package version that differs from the repository's static PEP 621 project version.\n\n**How to verify.** Compare the statement with pyproject.toml [project].version, update current installation or compatibility guidance, or move genuinely historical text to a changelog or release-note surface.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Public package-version guidance differs from static PEP 621 project metadata.\n\nWhy it matters: A public README or documentation page names an explicit package version that differs from the repository's static PEP 621 project version.\nHow to verify: Compare the statement with pyproject.toml [project].version, update current installation or compatibility guidance, or move genuinely historical text to a changelog or release-note surface."
              },
