            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A credential-named expression is passed to an import-bound logging call and may disclose sensitive material."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Import-bound logging call receives a credential-named expression.\n\n**Why it matters.** A credential-named expression is passed to an import-bound logging call and may disclose sensitive material.\n\n**How to verify.** Remove or redact the credential value before logging and verify captured logs contain only non-sensitive identifiers or digests.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Import-bound logging call receives a credential-named expression.\n\nWhy it matters: A credential-named expression is passed to an import-bound logging call and may disclose sensitive material.\nHow to verify: Remove or redact the credential value before logging and verify captured logs contain only non-sensitive identifiers or digests."
