            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The declared tracked CVD policy did not expose a syntactically bounded public contact address."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Tracked coordinated-vulnerability-disclosure policy lacks a public contact signal.\n\n**Why it matters.** The declared tracked CVD policy did not expose a syntactically bounded public contact address.\n\n**How to verify.** Review the complete public disclosure policy and verify a monitored public contact channel; aliases, routing, and response operation require independent evidence.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Tracked coordinated-vulnerability-disclosure policy lacks a public contact signal.\n\nWhy it matters: The declared tracked CVD policy did not expose a syntactically bounded public contact address.\nHow to verify: Review the complete public disclosure policy and verify a monitored public contact channel; aliases, routing, and response operation require independent evidence."
              },
