            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The newest imported component inventory is bound to a different exact repository state."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Imported component inventory is not bound to the current repository state.\n\n**Why it matters.** The newest imported component inventory is bound to a different exact repository state.\n\n**How to verify.** Review repository/SBOM drift and import a new externally generated SBOM only when appropriate; RIGOR-FOUNDRY does not generate an SBOM.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Imported component inventory is not bound to the current repository state.\n\nWhy it matters: The newest imported component inventory is bound to a different exact repository state.\nHow to verify: Review repository/SBOM drift and import a new externally generated SBOM only when appropriate; RIGOR-FOUNDRY does not generate an SBOM."
              },
