            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Explicit CRA scope has no readable declared offline state, so reporting-stage evidence cannot be assessed. An operational reporting-stage clock has an evidence anchor but no bound draft, receipt, or explicit already-provided skip."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "CRA event has a started reporting stage without a bound draft, receipt, or skip.\n\n**When the declared CRA state is unreadable.**\n\n**Why it matters.** Explicit CRA scope has no readable declared offline state, so reporting-stage evidence cannot be assessed.\n\n**How to verify.** Bootstrap or recover the local ignored CRA evidence tree, then repeat the scan; absence is unresolved evidence, not a passing result.\n\n**When a reporting-stage clock has no bound draft, receipt or skip.**\n\n**Why it matters.** An operational reporting-stage clock has an evidence anchor but no bound draft, receipt, or explicit already-provided skip.\n\n**How to verify.** Recompute the exact offline timeline and inspect operator evidence; only the manufacturer decides applicability and performs any submission.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "CRA event has a started reporting stage without a bound draft, receipt, or skip.\n\nWhen the declared CRA state is unreadable:\nWhy it matters: Explicit CRA scope has no readable declared offline state, so reporting-stage evidence cannot be assessed.\nHow to verify: Bootstrap or recover the local ignored CRA evidence tree, then repeat the scan; absence is unresolved evidence, not a passing result.\n\nWhen a reporting-stage clock has no bound draft, receipt or skip:\nWhy it matters: An operational reporting-stage clock has an evidence anchor but no bound draft, receipt, or explicit already-provided skip.\nHow to verify: Recompute the exact offline timeline and inspect operator evidence; only the manufacturer decides applicability and performs any submission."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#cr004-untracked-reporting-timeline",
              "id": "CR004-untracked-reporting-timeline",
