            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Operator-declared fixed-vulnerability state lacks a verified advisory publication record or justified-delay review record."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Fixed-vulnerability state lacks publication or justified-delay evidence.\n\n**Why it matters.** Operator-declared fixed-vulnerability state lacks a verified advisory publication record or justified-delay review record.\n\n**How to verify.** Inspect the fixed-vulnerability and security-update evidence, then bind only operator-confirmed publication or justified-delay records; RIGOR-FOUNDRY never publishes automatically.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Fixed-vulnerability state lacks publication or justified-delay evidence.\n\nWhy it matters: Operator-declared fixed-vulnerability state lacks a verified advisory publication record or justified-delay review record.\nHow to verify: Inspect the fixed-vulnerability and security-update evidence, then bind only operator-confirmed publication or justified-delay records; RIGOR-FOUNDRY never publishes automatically."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#cr006-fixed-vuln-without-advisory",
              "id": "CR006-fixed-vuln-without-advisory",
