            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A tracked GitHub Actions owner could not be completely analysed."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Tracked GitHub Actions YAML could not be completely analysed.\n\n**Why it matters.** A tracked GitHub Actions owner could not be completely analysed.\n\n**How to verify.** Read the exact tracked blob, resolve the bounded parser or structural limitation, and rerun. An unexplained incomplete owner cannot support a clean claim.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Tracked GitHub Actions YAML could not be completely analysed.\n\nWhy it matters: A tracked GitHub Actions owner could not be completely analysed.\nHow to verify: Read the exact tracked blob, resolve the bounded parser or structural limitation, and rerun. An unexplained incomplete owner cannot support a clean claim."
              },
