            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A pull_request_target checkout selects PR code or an unresolved dynamic source."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Target-event checkout selects PR code or an unresolved dynamic source.\n\n**Why it matters.** A pull_request_target checkout selects PR code or an unresolved dynamic source.\n\n**How to verify.** Review token permissions, secrets, downstream execution and the checkout version's fork protections, including allow-unsafe-pr-checkout. Prefer trusted base checkout; this configuration candidate does not prove that untrusted code was executed.\n\nA RigorFoundry result is an audit candidate for evidence review, never a defect verdict; only a validated review record decides it.",
                "text": "Target-event checkout selects PR code or an unresolved dynamic source.\n\nWhy it matters: A pull_request_target checkout selects PR code or an unresolved dynamic source.\nHow to verify: Review token permissions, secrets, downstream execution and the checkout version's fork protections, including allow-unsafe-pr-checkout. Prefer trusted base checkout; this configuration candidate does not prove that untrusted code was executed."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anulum/RIGOR-FOUNDRY/blob/main/docs/rule-catalogue.md#ga003-pull-request-target-checkout",
